SUMMARY:Colloquium (Parimal Patil\, Harvard)
DESCRIPTION:The Department is pleased to welcome Parimal Patil\, the Wales Professor of Sanskrit a professor in the Department of Philosophy at Harvard University for a colloquium on April 1\, 2027. He works on a wide range of topics in Sanskrit philosophy with particular interest in Buddhist epistemology and metaphysics during the final phase of Buddhism in India and the work of the New Epistemologist\, Gaṅgeśa. \nTitle\nTBD \nAbstract\nTBD
